export anchor EspressoStyle:
    number: 236
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Espresso
    idea:
        A warm coffee house menu board in dark roast browns, where projects
        are listed like menu items with dotted leaders running to their
        percent, figures sit under crema rules, and activity prints on a
        narrow order ticket.
    base: dark
    palette:
        roast: #1b130e, the page and the style sheet
        bean: #241913, the header band
        board: #2b1f17, the menu board and chart panel
        cup: #382a20, the search field, meter tracks and the ticket
        line: #54402f, board borders, rules and leaders
        ink: #f3e7d8, text and figures
        steam: #cbb59c, meta, labels, dates and axis text
        crema: #e4b97f, the primary button, figures rules, meters, this week bars, links and focus
        cremaInk: #241508, text on crema
        caramel: #b8844f, last week bar outlines and hatching
        ok: #a9d48f, On track text and check circle
        risk: #f2c862, At risk text and triangle
        bad: #f4977f, Behind and overdue text, crossed square and clock
    type:
        Three warm stacks. Headings use Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype,
        Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia, serif, with the greeting 38px italic
        at 500, house figures 40px, board headings 22px at 600 and menu items
        18px at 500. Body and meta use Optima, Candara, Segoe UI, sans-serif
        at 14px and 1.5. The order ticket uses Courier New, ui-monospace at
        13px. Nav and small labels are 12px caps tracked 0.14em.
    layout:
        One centred 1080px column. A two tier bean header band holds a serif
        Brightwork wordmark with a small cup mark at left and a search field,
        a bell, a crema New project button and Mara Okafor at right, then
        under a thin rule the six nav links centred as caps text with a crema
        underline under Home. Below, the greeting is centred like a board
        title, with the date and a line reading 4 tasks are overdue with a
        clock in coral. The four figures sit in a row between crema top and
        bottom rules, split by thin vertical rules, each a large serif number
        over a caps label, overdue in coral. The main board is a bordered dark
        panel titled The projects, a two column menu where each item is a
        serif name, a dotted leader and the percent like a price, then
        category, tasks and due date, a 3px crema meter and the status word
        with its symbol. Last, two blocks side by side, a wide chart panel of
        paired bars by weekday with last week as hatched caramel outlines and
        this week solid crema, and a narrow order ticket on a cup surface with
        a zigzag top and bottom edge, listing activity with mono times. Below
        820px the menu becomes one column, figures go two by two and the
        ticket drops under the chart.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px board padding, 20px between menu items, 40px between blocks.
    density: Medium. Menu items are roomy, the ticket is tight.
    corners: Mostly square with gentle 6px corners on the board, fields and buttons.
    borders:
        1px line around the board and chart, crema 2px rules above and below
        the figures, dotted leaders in line colour.
    shadows:
        An inset 0 0 0 4px roast band inside the board border, like a frame,
        and no drop shadows.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.6px stroke sized to the text. Status uses a check
        circle, a triangle with a bang and a crossed square, always with the
        word, overdue a clock.
    focus: A 2px crema outline offset 3px.
    tone: Warm and unhurried, such as Good morning, Mara, The projects and Today's ticket.
